2026-02-01
- dtpad/editor: added a dropped-files handling mode (auto/paths/content) wired
  through resources, a new Options submenu, dtpadrc persistence, and ToolTalk
  context propagation, with text detection via DTS and localized labels.
- dtterm: added CDE DnD filename drop handling to insert shell-safe, backslash-escaped
  paths into terminal input, with multiple items separated by single spaces.
- dtterm: persist the last selected Options -> Font Size choice in ~/.dt/dttermrc
  and restore it for new instances unless a saved session provides a font size.
- dtfile: aligned drag hotspots with the click position using state icons and explicit
  hot spot handling, plus shelf drag adjustments and color fixes for shelf icons.
- dtfile: escape quotes and backslashes in command action file arguments, and
  handle escaped single quotes in command parsing to allow opening files with
  ', ", or \ in their names.
